  "editorial": [
    "Bars count the opening pickup as bar 1. Bar references align with the backing ledger.",
    "The grouping in bars 62 and 63 (p. 4, system 3) is inferred from the parallel refrain and the piano bass bar lines. The first group in both measures uses triplet time, with the original dotted subdivision compressed proportionally. Bar 62 has two triplet groups.",
    "Where groups of five or six flagged canto notes exceed 2/4 and the triplet numeral is absent, the guide follows the printed grouping of the piano part and the corresponding earlier canto phrase.",
    "The terminal fermata takes the nominal note or rest value. The printed D.C. is a separate performance choice."
  ]
